  "body": "This PR adds documentation clarifying when AsyncIterableObject should be\r\nused versus AsyncIterableProducer.\r\n\r\nThis aligns with the conclusions of issue #256854 and helps prevent\r\nfuture memory issues or incorrect migrations.",
