   "body": "## Pull request overview\n\nThis PR adds inline documentation in `src/vs/base/common/async.ts` clarifying when `AsyncIterableObject` is appropriate (multi-iteration) versus when `AsyncIterableProducer` should be preferred (single-consumption/streaming) to avoid retaining emitted values.\n\n**Changes:**\n- Add a guideline comment near `AsyncIterableObject` describing safe usage patterns.\n- Point readers to the background discussion/migration rationale from issue #256854.\n\n\n\n",
